From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: koyu <me@koyu.space>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 01:18:33 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 06/17] Add a preview mode that changes nothing on the system

With PLASMA_SETUP_PREVIEW=1 (just preview) the wizard runs as usual but
doesn't create the user, mark setup as done, log out, restart, shut down,
or set the hostname, time zone, language, keyboard layout or Wi-Fi
connection; Finish quits. Pages installed in more than one data dir (the
preview's stage and /usr/share) are only listed once.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
